 "A maths tutoring service in Accra asks a reasoning model to solve a problem with sixteen cases. One worker writes it all, one token after another.": "c94ce7b970.mp3",
 "Hogwild inference runs four copies of the same model on one shared memory cache. Each sees every word the others write, the moment it is written.": "0dd212ea56.mp3",
