 "Give each worker its own cache, and none can see the others. Each one solves every case, and nothing is gained.": "6a45bd5ea1.mp3",
 "A model not trained to reason ignores what the others have claimed, repeats their cases and wastes tokens.": "3b9bfe5be9.mp3",
